      50.64,
      394.63,
      286.4,
      450.77
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
