    "bbox": [
      65.04,
      452.24,
      227.16,
      462.32
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      462.82,
      286.43,
      562.88
    ],
    "text": "Allotments of land in extent of about 0.0436 Hectare, depicted in the Preliminary Plan No. Gam. 3963 was prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the village of Ihala Biyanvila, in the Grama Niladari Division No. 269B, Ihala Biyanvila Central, in the Minor Division of Adikari Paththuwa, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Biyagama, in the Gampaha District in Western province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItal",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      9.118988037109375,
